        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Formal Leaders will be notified at 32 hours that an employee's absence is nearing the 41 hour non-FML standard. They will advise the employee that they are at risk of exceeding the standard and should be prepared to administer the program as soon as the employee exceeds the standard.",
